<title>USA: ITT Hartford Hurricane Fran loss $0.30/shr.</title>
<headline>ITT Hartford Hurricane Fran loss $0.30/shr.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITT Hartford Group Inc, an insurance and financial services company, said Thursday it expects losses from Hurricane Fran to total about $35 million after taxes for the third quarter, or $0.30 per share.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't anticipate the total will grow,&quot; said company spokeswoman Sue Honeyman in a telephone interview.</p>
<p>The company said the property losses were primarily inland where falling trees created greater than expected structural damage, the company said.</p>
